blic general-election polling is available, so the race is judged on fundamentals and expert assessments.\n\nRaters overwhelmingly call the seat Likely or Safe Democratic, and prediction markets price Mrvan's chances around 95%. The main complication is Republican momentum: Trump endorsed Regnitz in July and national GOP groups have signaled they will spend to flip the seat. That keeps the race competitive on paper but still clearly favors the incumbent.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9569, "margin": 11.29}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9243, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9241, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9308, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9246, "margin": 10.6}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9079, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.9227, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.9457, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9206, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9443, "margin": 10.5}]}